<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian Breweries profit marginally up.</title>
<headline>Nigerian Breweries profit marginally up.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year result for Nigerian Breweries Plc to end-June. (In million naira)</p>
<p>				    1996	    1995</p>
<p>Turnover			 5,200	 vs 4,300</p>
<p>Profit before taxation     1,000	 vs 1,000</p>
<p>Taxation			   428	 vs   453.4</p>
<p>Profit after taxation	  642.3     vs   554</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
</text>
